{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 12, "result": {"contents": [{"mimeType": "text/plain", "uri": "ucas://help", "text": "definitions\n  f(x: u8, y: i16 in -5..5) = expr [where y = expr, cond]\n  g = x^2 + 1               free variables become parameters\n  basis name [: parent] { gate(x, y) = expr [cost n]; ... }\n  model name [: parent] { class: cost, ..., fuse f(a: int, ...) = expr : cost }\ntypes: real (math), f16 f32 f64 (IEEE), int (math), uN iN (wrapping), bool\ncommands (F is a function name or an expression like isqrt(x: u4))\n  show F | parse EXPR | table F [max n] | funcs | models | help\n  range F [nocrit] | domain F | wrap F | crit F | diff F [x]\n  equiv F G [ftz|noftz] [nanbits] | error G ~ F\n  fit G ~ F [metric maxrel|maxabs|rms]\n  gates F [basis b] [max k] [nodes n] [as c]\n  find F [n] [max cost] | more [n]\n  cost F [model m] [consecutive i] | use m\n  stoke F [steps n] [restarts r] [len l] [seed k] [model m]\n  pit F G [trials n] [seed k] | phash F [seed k] [model m]\n  dword F [tol r | atol t | ulp x] [model m] | foldproof F [model m]\n  banks F [, G ...] [size n] [elem b] [model m]\n  intatomic F [count n] [tol t] [global] [model m]\n  rop F [model m] | texalu F [tol e] [model m]\n  texenc T [, U] [astc BWxBH [srgb] | eac | etc2 [srgb] | bc7 [srgb] |\n    bc6h] [rows w] [tol e]\n  approx F [in a..b] [degree n|a..b] [error e] [ulp u] [as f32|f64|real]\n    [relative|absolute] [odd|even|nosym] [keep endpoints|x1, x2..]\n    [weight W] [at c] [fma|nofma] [norefine] [list n] [name p] [c]\n  approx more [n]\n  animate [hillis|blelloch|sequential] scan [n N] [fps F] [seconds S]\n    [random [seed K] | values a, b, ...] [f32] [MODEL] [to NAME]\n  plot F, G ... [x in a..b] [y in c..d] [deriv] [tangent a] [logx|logy]\n    [contour|heatmap|wireframe|3d] [rotate] [animate t] [slices|parallel]\n    [polar] [field] [fps F] [frames N] [to NAME]; plot3d F; neighbourhood F\n    [at a]\nloops and calculus\n  sum(i, lo, hi, e) | prod(...) | x[0] = c; x[k+1] = ... | { for/while/if }\n  closed F | scheme F [more] [model m] | continuous F\n  integrate F [wrt x] [from a to b] | antiderivative F [wrt x]\n  diff F [x y ...] [n] | grad|hessian|laplacian F [at a, b] | F'' | F'(a)\n  jacobian F, G [wrt x, y] [at ...] | ddir F along v [at p] [raw]\n  limit F x -> a[+|-] [from left|right] | lim x->a F | wronskian F, G, ...\n  taylor F [x] [at a] [order n] | implicit L = R [for y] [wrt x] [order 2]\n  y' = f(t, y); y(0) = c | pde name { ... } | dsolve y [from a to b] [steps n]\ncomplex numbers (i is the unit) and trig forms\n  complex F | re F | im F | conj F | modulus F | arg F | polar F\n  nthroots N F | unity N | trig F [expand|reduce|product|sum|sincos|exp|harmonic|half|inverse]\nalgebra\n  expand|factor|simplify|together|cancel F | collect|apart F [in x]\n  gcd|lcm P, Q | resultant P, Q [in x] | discriminant P [in x]\n  quo|rem P, Q [in x] | divide P by Q | substitute x = a in F\n  solve L = R [, L2 = R2] [for x, y]\nproperties\n  monotonic|period|periodic|parity|symmetry|bounded|injective|surjective|\n    bijective|continuity|discontinuities|convexity|asymptotes|zeros F\n    [x] [in a..b] | identify EXPR | identify L = R\ncomplex, quaternion, octonion (z, w complex; i j k; e1..e31)\n  holomorphic F | residue F at a | poles F | integrate F around |z| = r\n  table quaternion|octonion|sedenion | algebra NAME [property]\n  zerodivisors | associator a, b, c | commutator a, b\n  rotate V by Q | rotate V by ANGLE about AXIS | axisangle | rotmatrix |\n    frommatrix | slerp\nrings and finite fields (Z/n, mod n, GF(p^n [, aes|0x11b|f]))\n  ring R [EXPR|units|zerodivisors|ideals|field|table|minpoly A|log A]\n  inverse A mod N | order A mod N | phi N | carmichael N | factorint N\n  crt | solve ... mod m | legendre | jacobi | sqrtmod | primroot N |\n    dlog A base G mod N | magic D [uN|iN] | gf2matrix EXPR [uN]\n  factor|irreducible|primitive|roots F over GF(q) | det|rank|nullspace|\n    inverse M mod p\nintegrals and solids\n  area F [and G] [from a to b] [riemann [N] [left|right|mid|trapezoid|\n    simpson]] [accumulate] | revolve F [and G] [from a to b]\n    [about x|y|y = c|x = c] [disk|washer|shell] [still] [rotate]\n  volume | surfacearea | arclength F from a to b | centroid F [and G]\nEnglish works too: 'what is the range of x squared for a signed byte x?'\n  ('help english' for more)\n"}]}}
